01:00:28,370 --> 01:00:31,860
These reinforce accountability, making sure people do what they said they would.

969
01:00:32,580 --> 01:00:36,780
And it reassures every stakeholder that the resolution is being actively pursued.

970
01:00:36,880 --> 01:00:39,640
Preventing old resentments from creeping back in.

971
01:00:39,780 --> 01:00:40,170
Exactly.

972
01:00:40,190 --> 01:00:41,870
Keeps things moving forward positively.

973
01:00:42,210 --> 01:00:45,550
That insight about building trust long term really resonates.

974
01:00:46,140 --> 01:00:49,940
