975
01:00:50,360 --> 01:00:55,250
How do you make sure it doesn't just pop up again or even better, prevent future conflicts entirely?

976
01:00:55,770 --> 01:00:57,510
Ah, now we're getting into proactive territory.

977
01:00:57,720 --> 01:00:58,060
Right.

978
01:00:58,260 --> 01:01:00,020
