Maybe even deeper.

1010
01:02:24,620 --> 01:02:27,470
Spending a week doing someone else's job, for instance.

1011
01:02:27,490 --> 01:02:32,140
This allows people to truly appreciate diverse responsibilities and the pressures others face.

1012
01:02:32,270 --> 01:02:34,260
Walking a mile in their shoes, literally.

1013
