Pretty much.

1014
01:02:35,320 --> 01:02:39,860
Imagine a marketing person spending a week in sales or an engineer shadowing customer support.

1015
01:02:40,500 --> 01:02:44,470
That direct exposure, as the sources reveal, fosters a deeper understanding.

1016
01:02:45,010 --> 01:02:47,230
It breaks down that us versus them mentality.

1017
01:02:47,390 --> 01:02:47,970
I can see that.

1018
01:02:48,200 --> 01:02:50,740
Additionally, cross-functional exercises are recommended.

1019
01:02:51,200 --> 01:02:53,720
Things like joint projects or problem-solving sessions.

1020
01:02:54,340 --> 01:02:58,870
These can further dissolve departmental barriers and strengthen overall cooperation.

1021
01:02:59,200 --> 01:03:04,310
Creating a more cohesive workplace where conflict is just less likely to take root.

1022
01:03:04,610 --> 01:03:05,170
