1051
01:04:25,640 --> 01:04:27,340
Like internal influencers.

1052
01:04:27,360 --> 01:04:27,900
Kind of, yeah.

1053
01:04:28,500 --> 01:04:35,230
Furthermore, training these ambassadors as conflict facilitators might help de-escalate future disputes faster and more consistently.

1054
01:04:35,750 --> 01:04:37,050
They become internal resources.

1055
