Go-to people for minor issues, maybe.

1056
01:04:39,640 --> 01:04:40,050
Exactly.

1057
01:04:40,360 --> 01:04:41,480
Preventing them from escalating.

1058
01:04:41,740 --> 01:04:45,680
Beyond formal policies, leadership development and continuous learning are critical.

1059
01:04:45,980 --> 01:04:46,980
Training the managers.

1060
01:04:47,420 --> 01:04:47,660
Yes.

1061
01:04:48,510 --> 01:04:54,950
Offering leadership workshops, for instance, could significantly improve managerial skills for handling tense conversations tactfully.

1062
01:04:55,360 --> 01:05:00,300
