Strategic debriefings after resolved conflicts are highlighted as a powerful tool.

1066
01:05:07,620 --> 01:05:10,200
They help refine best practices across multiple teams.

1067
01:05:10,740 --> 01:05:12,120
It's a continuous learning loop.

1068
01:05:12,410 --> 01:05:13,490
What worked, what didn't.

1069
01:05:13,630 --> 01:05:14,150
Precisely.

