01:08:15,910 --> 01:08:19,410
Consistent follow-through on each session's action items is crucial.

1131
01:08:20,030 --> 01:08:23,010
And one suggestion I liked was sharing quick video recaps.

1132
01:08:23,190 --> 01:08:24,200
Bite-sized reminders.

1133
01:08:24,260 --> 01:08:24,480
Yeah.

1134
01:08:25,000 --> 01:08:27,960
Ensuring everyone remembers essential techniques after each training.

1135
01:08:28,380 --> 01:08:31,390
Makes the knowledge accessible and memorable for sustained change.

1136
01:08:31,710 --> 01:08:32,050
Smart.

1137
01:08:32,470 --> 01:08:33,570
Keep it top of mind.

1138
01:08:33,770 --> 01:08:36,470
So it's about practical application and reinforcement.

