01:10:59,720 --> 01:11:01,650
That transparency piece seems huge.

1188
01:11:02,330 --> 01:11:04,830
Building on that, it's not just what we say, right?

1189
01:11:05,130 --> 01:11:08,760
It's how we say it that profoundly impacts workplace dynamics.

