01:11:10,100 --> 01:11:15,420
Our sources delve into the nuances of communication, particularly examining nonverbal cues.

1192
01:11:15,500 --> 01:11:16,940
Body language, tone of voice.

1193
01:11:17,420 --> 01:11:17,920
Exactly.

1194
01:11:18,480 --> 01:11:24,790
They stress that tone and body language significantly impact conversations, often conveying more than the words themselves.

1195
01:11:25,490 --> 01:11:27,390
Consider a simple, okay.

1196
01:11:27,790 --> 01:11:30,690
