The continuous promotion of trust and honesty is deemed vital for sustaining a positive atmosphere.

1215
01:12:28,200 --> 01:12:30,560
It's the bedrock for all communication efforts.

1216
01:12:30,590 --> 01:12:32,600
I can see how that cultivates a healthy environment.

