01:55:16,350 --> 01:55:22,850
And paraphrasing the feedback can be incredibly valuable, saying something like, okay, so what I'm hearing is you think my emails could be more concise.

1931
01:55:23,250 --> 01:55:24,620
Right, confirms understanding.

1932
01:55:24,760 --> 01:55:25,200
Exactly.

1933
01:55:25,220 --> 01:55:29,220
It confirms you got it, and it gives a moment to clarify if there was a misunderstanding.

1934
01:55:29,620 --> 01:55:36,210
And honestly, even just a sincere thank you for the feedback, even if it stings a bit, can do wonders to just diffuse the tension in the moment.

1935
01:55:36,430 --> 01:55:38,950
